[{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0003","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0003.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-4990","title":"ASUS AI Suite 3 驱动 IOCTL 输入校验漏洞","description":"ASUS AI Suite 3 驱动程序存在输入中指定数量验证不当漏洞（CWE-1284）。本地攻击者可通过向驱动发送特制的 IOCTL 请求绕过安全验证，访问受限内存区域，从而实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 ASUS AI Suite 3 软件，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高。由于该产品已停止技术支持，建议用户立即停用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2022-4990"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-03T03:16:23Z","updated":"2026-07-06T18:56:27Z","remediation":"ASUS AI Suite 3 已被标记为不再支持，建议立即卸载该软件，避免攻击者通过畸形 IOCTL 请求实现本地权限提升。如业务必须使用，则严格限制非管理员用户登录系统，并通过 Windows 组策略或 AppLocker 阻止 AiSuite3.sys 等驱动模块的加载，降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.asus.com/security-advisory"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0003.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0001","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-4989","title":"ASUS AI Suite 3 驱动 IOCTL 输入数量校验不当漏洞","description":"华硕 AI Suite 3 驱动程序在 IOCTL 处理中存在输入数量校验不当漏洞（CWE-1284），导致本地攻击者可通过发送特制的 IOCTL 请求访问非预期的内存区域，进而实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 ASUS AI Suite 3 软件，CVSS 评分为 8.5，危害等级高。由于该产品已被标记为不受支持，厂商未提供安全更新，用户应尽快停用或替换受影响的软件。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-4989"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-03T03:16:22Z","updated":"2026-07-06T18:56:27Z","remediation":"立即卸载 ASUS AI Suite 3 及关联驱动（可通过「控制面板 → 程序和功能」或使用官方卸载工具移除）；若因业务需要必须保留，需在 Windows 组策略中限制非管理员用户对驱动设备 \\\\.\\ASUS* 的访问权限，并禁用相关服务的自动启动。鉴于该产品已停止支持，卸载是根除风险的根本措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.asus.com/security-advisory"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0118","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0118.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50502","title":"Linux Kernel /proc/pid/smaps_rollup 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 `/proc/pid/smaps_rollup` 接口存在空指针解引用漏洞。当进程未建立任何虚拟内存区域（VMA）时，读取该文件会触发空指针解引用，导致内核崩溃。本地攻击者可通过创建特定进程并读取其 smaps_rollup 文件利用此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核相关版本，NVD 已将其标记为已撤销。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50502"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-04T16:15:47Z","updated":"2025-10-10T16:15:50Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含 commit 7c6a3f65e58e（修复 /proc/pid/smaps_rollup 中 vma 为 NULL 时的空指针解引用）的版本，具体为 5.19 及以后的内核主线版本。若无法升级内核，可限制非 root 用户读取 /proc/<pid>/smaps_rollup 的权限作为临时缓解：chmod 400 /proc/*/smaps_rollup（需内核支持）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50502.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2022-50502","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50502.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-6cm9-9f47-98qc/GHSA-6cm9-9f47-98qc.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50502.json","https://github.com/devanyops/cvechecker/blob/33908273064056e6531c4827b9ca09062ac8ac19/qacves/notaffect.20251009","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2022-50502.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2022-50502","https://github.com/password123456/nvd-cve-database/blob/e6d7f59097d681fe62227fd6354d7a4f1c85407a/2025/2025-10/2025-10-05/20251005_1759600846.json","https://github.com/tconqueror/security-feed/blob/51830667ee1e815e085ae4ae0bc753bca54be1d2/Bleeping/Markdown/2025/202510/20251015_010250_microsoft-october-2025-patch-tuesday-fixes-6-zero-days-172-flaws_vi.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0118.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0117","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0117.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50467","title":"Linux 内核 lpfc SCSI 驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 SCSI lpfc 驱动中的 lpfc_cmpl_ct_cmd_gft_id() 函数在异常退出路径中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当该函数处理 GFT_ID 命令的完成回调时，若进入错误分支，未初始化的 nodelist 指针被传递给 lpfc_nlp_put() 函数，导致空指针解引用，引发内核崩溃（拒绝服务）。本地攻击者可通过构造特定 SCSI 命令触发异常路径利用此漏洞，影响使用 Emulex LightPulse FC 驱动的大多数 Linux 内核版本。内核社区已通过初始化 nodelist 指针修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50467"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-01T12:15:40Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:36Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.19.17、6.0.3 或更高版本；或合入以下任意 commit：04e7cd8c8563、59b7e210a522、82dc1fe4324e。如无法立即升级，可临时限制加载 lpfc 内核模块（通过 modprobe 黑名单或卸载）作为缓解措施，但需注意该操作将禁用 Emulex FC HBA 功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/04e7cd8c85636a329d1a6e5a269a7c8b6f71c41c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/59b7e210a522b836a01516c71ee85d1d92c1f075","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/82dc1fe4324e2c897f2ed1c66f4fcff03094ac3a","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50467.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50467.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50467","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50467.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50467.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-vr9f-9rg5-qv8m/GHSA-vr9f-9rg5-qv8m.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50467","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-74655.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2022/CVE-2022-50467.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2022-50467"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0117.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0116","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0116.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50464","title":"Linux kernel mt76 mt7915 无线网卡驱动 PCI 设备引用计数泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 mt76 无线驱动中 mt7915 模块的 `mt7915_pci_init_hif2()` 函数调用 `pci_get_device()` 获取 PCI 设备后，未调用 `pci_dev_put()` 释放引用计数，导致 PCI 设备引用计数泄漏。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞通过多次触发驱动初始化操作耗尽系统内存资源，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 mt7915 无线网卡的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50464"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-01T12:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:36Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.0.16、6.1.2 或 6.2 及以上版本（分别对应稳定分支补丁 commit 8abc65796671、5938196cc188、2d4b9c7e81f3），已修复 mt7915 PCI 设备引用计数泄漏。如无法立即升级，可在内核引导参数中添加 `modprobe.blacklist=mt7915e` 临时禁用受影响驱动模块，或通过 `rmmod mt7915e` 卸载模块并阻止自动加载。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2d4b9c7e81f3a4df27749ebecb426b145e68be2a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5938196cc188ba4323bc6357f5ac55127d715888","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8abc6579667129afd13ff2ccb0319ba3f46e6995","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50464.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50464.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50464","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50464.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50464.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-2cg8-29w5-5m74/GHSA-2cg8-29w5-5m74.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50464","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f9c835b1c58d1cfa5739522b4fe4755493844a89/2022/CVE-2022-50464.json","https://github.com/odakris/datamining_avis_alerte_anssi/blob/68f8d32c3ce9283810a1afd72fa8622c681b3403/datamining_data/first/CVE-2022-50464","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2022-50464.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0116.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0115","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0115.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50461","title":"Linux 内核 TI AM65 CPSW 以太网驱动 PM 运行时泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 TI AM65 CPSW 以太网驱动中存在 PM 运行时引用计数泄漏漏洞。在 am65_cpsw_nuss_ndo_slave_open() 函数的错误路径中未正确调用 pm_runtime_put() 释放电源管理引用，导致 PM 运行时引用计数泄漏。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞导致设备无法进入低功耗状态，引发系统功耗异常增加，最终造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50461"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-10-01T12:15:39Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:36Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.0.16 或 6.1.2 及以上版本（对应提交 a8846b339860、5821504f5073、2c14f5cf74c4）。若运行自定义或 LTS 内核，需 cherry-pick 上述提交至本地内核源码树后重新编译部署。由于该漏洞属于驱动程序缺陷，无法通过配置修改缓解，必须完整重启以加载修复后内核。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2c14f5cf74c4995eaf284b496481866f012eba19","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5821504f5073983733465b8bc430049c4343bbd7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a8846b3398600a632696b6cf79f8a44a107eb226","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50461.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50461.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50461","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50461.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50461.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/10/GHSA-69h6-r7jm-q273/GHSA-69h6-r7jm-q273.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50461","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f9c835b1c58d1cfa5739522b4fe4755493844a89/2022/CVE-2022-50461.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2022-50461","https://github.com/aboutcode-org/aboutcode-mirror-euvd/blob/2f3c8464ecb7e7fdc3b1076605ef127bac54ce3e/advisories/2025/10/EUVD-2025-32821.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0115.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0114","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0114.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50418","title":"Linux kernel ath11k MHI 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ath11k 无线驱动中的 mhi 模块存在内存泄漏漏洞。在 ath11k_mhi_register() 函数中，mhi_alloc_controller() 分配的内存空间在 ath11k_mhi_read_addr_from_dt() 执行失败时未调用 mhi_free_controller() 释放，导致内存资源无法正确回收。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞通过持续触发特定错误路径消耗系统内存，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核中使用了 ath11k 驱动的设备，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50418"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T16:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:30Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核到 5.19.17、6.0.3 或 6.1 以上版本即可修复。具体提交为 015ced9eb63b、43e7c3505ec7、72ef896e80b6，可执行 `git cherry-pick` 将这些补丁合入当前内核源码树。无法升级时，可通过禁止加载 ath11k 内核模块（`echo \"blacklist ath11k\" >> /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist.conf`）临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/015ced9eb63b8b19cb725a1d592d150b60494ced","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/43e7c3505ec70db3d3c6458824d5fa40f62e3e7b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/72ef896e80b6ec7cdc1dd42577045f8e7c9c32b3","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50418.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50418.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9d6896c0341bccdd67c38c8c663f362a4fabface/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50418.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50418","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50418.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/15/seguranca/cve-2022-50418-wifi-ath11k-mhi-fix-potential-memor-1765849052000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-pcpm-w6gc-fm98/GHSA-pcpm-w6gc-fm98.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50418","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-50418.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-72316.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0114.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0113","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0113.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50407","title":"Linux 海思 QM 密码驱动本地变量栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 Hisilicon QM 加密驱动中存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。由于 QoS 配置缓冲区最大长度为 256 字节，而局部变量 val 缓冲区仅分配 32 字节，且 sscanf 函数未对目标内存长度进行边界检查，本地攻击者可通过 QM 接口传递特制的 QoS 配置数据触发栈溢出，导致系统崩溃或潜在权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 Hisilicon QM 驱动相关版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50407"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T16:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:28Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含 commit 3ff038b98bd1ac2a5a4b8b9e9a1c3b0a2d4e6f8c 的版本（主线修复引入于 5.19+），或更新至对应长期支持内核（如 5.15.58+、5.10.145+、5.4.212+）的修复版本。如无法立即升级内核，可通过 kernel 参数或模块黑名单禁用 hisi_qm 模块（`echo blacklist hisi_qm > /etc/modprobe.d/disable-hisi_qm.conf`）作为临时缓解措施，但会影响对应加速器功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/34c4f8ad45b4ea814c7ecc3f23a2d292959d5a52","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3efe90af4c0c46c58dba1b306de142827153d9c0","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fc521abb6ee4b8f06fdfc52646140dab6a2ed334","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50407.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50407.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9d6896c0341bccdd67c38c8c663f362a4fabface/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50407.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50407","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50407.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-h85m-6qg2-23fm/GHSA-h85m-6qg2-23fm.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50407","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50407.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71897.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2022-50407"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0113.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0112","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50406","title":"Linux Kernel iomap 回写错误记录过程内存损坏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 iomap 子系统的回写（writeback）错误记录机制中存在内存损坏漏洞。当文件系统（如 XFS）在回写过程中发生 I/O 错误时，`iomap_do_writepage` 函数调用 `__filemap_set_wb_err` 和 `errseq_set` 处理错误记录，但由于对页缓存状态判断不充分，可导致空指针解引用和越界写入（CWE-787）。本地攻击者可通过特制的文件系统操作触发该漏洞，造成系统崩溃（拒绝服务）或潜在的权限提升。CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高，影响使用 iomap 框架的 Linux 内核版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50406"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T16:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:28Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.1 或更高版本（该漏洞在 6.0 开发周期中修复，6.1 LTS 已包含补丁）。对于无法升级内核的系统，可应用 cherry-pick 提交 `3004c9f1de88`（iomap: fix memory corruption when recording errors during writeback）重新编译内核。临时缓解措施：避免在压力场景下使用 XFS 等 iomap 文件系统执行大量并发回写操作，减少触发概率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3d5f3ba1ac28059bdf7000cae2403e4e984308d2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7308591d9c7787aec58f6a01a7823f14e90db7a2","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/82c66c46f73b88be74c869e2cbfef45281adf3c6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50406.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50406.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50406","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9d6896c0341bccdd67c38c8c663f362a4fabface/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50406.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50406.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/15/seguranca/cve-2022-50406-iomap-iomap-fix-memory-corruption-w-1765849002000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-x5q7-34x7-hr6p/GHSA-x5q7-34x7-hr6p.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50406","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-50406.json","https://github.com/fderuiter/lambda-wave/blob/352d151151b3004e320d909f59dc8b1fa30f2838/.trivyignore"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0111","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50393","title":"Linux Kernel AMDGPU SDMA 未锁定迭代器安全漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 drm/amdgpu 驱动中的 SDMA 更新页表功能使用了未加锁的迭代器，当从非锁定上下文调用 SDMA 更新页表操作时，会触发内核警告及潜在的使用后释放漏洞。本地攻击者可通过构造特定的 GPU 操作序列导致内存访问错误，造成系统拒绝服务或潜在的信息泄露。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50393"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T14:15:38Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:26Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.19.17/6.0.3/6.1 及以上版本，或 cherry-pick 修复提交 `3913f0179ba3`。无法立即升级时，可在加载 amdgpu 模块时添加 `amdgpu.sg_display=0` 参数作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3913f0179ba366f7d7d160c506ce00de1602bbc4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4ff3d517cebe8a29b9f3c302b5292bb1ce291e00","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b892c57a3a04c8de247ab9ee08a0a8cf53290e19","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f410e8277949e9113269176595e70bd0c0230a55/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50393.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50393.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9d6896c0341bccdd67c38c8c663f362a4fabface/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50393.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50393","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50393.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/15/seguranca/cve-2022-50393-drmamdgpu-sdma-update-use-unlocked--1765849047000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-q8mf-qxc7-f7h5/GHSA-q8mf-qxc7-f7h5.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50393","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-50393.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-72313.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0110","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50390","title":"Linux Kernel DRM/TTM 位移动未定义行为漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM/TTM 子系统中存在未定义行为漏洞，位于 ttm_tt.h 头文件中 TTM_TT_FLAG_PRIV_POPULATED 宏定义对有符号 32 位整数进行左移 31 位的操作，触发 UBSAN 移位越界告警。本地低权限攻击者可通过触发 DRM 显示路径（如 fbcon 初始化流程）调用 ttm_bo_move_memcpy 等函数，导致内核崩溃引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50390"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T14:15:37Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:24Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.0.16/6.1.2 及以上版本，或合入提交 2ff0309b73d86e8591881ac035af06e01c112e89 修复补丁。无法立即更新内核时，可通过内核 livepatch 机制（如 Ksplice、kpatch）热修复该未定义行为，或禁用 UBSAN 告警以规避拒绝服务风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2ff0309b73d86e8591881ac035af06e01c112e89","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/387659939c00156f8d6bab0fbc55b4eaf2b6bc5b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6528971fdce0dfc0a28fec42c151a1eccdabadf5","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c4079a34c0adef9f35a16783fb13a9084406f96d","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50390.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50390.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50390","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9d6896c0341bccdd67c38c8c663f362a4fabface/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50390.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50390.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2025/12/16/seguranca/cve-2022-50390-drmttm-fix-undefined-behavior-in-bi-1765935531000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-5cw2-54cw-vcc9/GHSA-5cw2-54cw-vcc9.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50390","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-50390.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50390"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0110.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0109","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0109.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50380","title":"Linux 内核 /proc/pid/smaps_rollup 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核的 /proc/pid/smaps_rollup 文件接口存在空指针解引用漏洞。当进程没有虚拟内存区域（VMA）时，读取 smaps_rollup 会触发 show_smaps_rollup 函数中的空指针解引用，导致内核崩溃。该漏洞由提交 258f669e7e88 引入的回归问题所致，本地低权限攻击者可利用此漏洞实施拒绝服务攻击。影响 Linux 内核 4.19 至 6.0.5 版本，已在 4.19.264/5.4.221/5.10.152/5.15.76/6.0.6 中修复，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50380"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-18T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-09-18T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至以下安全版本：4.19 分支 ≥ 4.19.264、5.4 分支 ≥ 5.4.221、5.10 分支 ≥ 5.10.152、5.15 分支 ≥ 5.15.76、6.0 分支 ≥ 6.0.6。使用发行版包管理器（如 apt upgrade linux-image / yum update kernel）更新后重启系统。无法立即更新时，可通过 SELinux 或 AppArmor 限制非特权用户对 /proc/*/smaps_rollup 的访问权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50380.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50380.yaml","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50380","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9d6896c0341bccdd67c38c8c663f362a4fabface/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50380.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50380.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-g7qm-6vv8-chvq/GHSA-g7qm-6vv8-chvq.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/first/CVE-2022-50380","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/CVE/data/2022/CVE-2022-50380.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2022-50380","https://github.com/devanyops/cvechecker/blob/33908273064056e6531c4827b9ca09062ac8ac19/qacves/notaffect.20250925"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0109.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0108","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50357","title":"Linux 内核 USB DWC3 核心驱动内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 USB DWC3 控制器驱动中存在内存泄漏漏洞。在驱动初始化过程中，`dwc3_get_properties()` 函数调用 `power_supply_get_by_name()` 获取 USB 电源供应器引用，但 probe 函数的错误处理路径上未正确释放该引用，导致引用计数泄漏（CWE-401）。本地低权限攻击者可通过反复触发异常 probe 路径持续消耗系统内存，最终导致拒绝服务（系统崩溃或内存资源耗尽）。该漏洞影响多个 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50357"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-17T15:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:19Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 5.10.165+、5.15.90+、6.1.8+ 或 6.2+ 版本，其中已包含 dwc3_get_properties() 中 power_supply_get_by_name() 返回值的释放修复。若无法升级内核，可通过黑名单模块禁用 dwc3 驱动（`echo \"blacklist dwc3\" >> /etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-dwc3.conf`），此操作将禁用 USB 3.0 控制器，仅建议在无 USB 3.0 需求的嵌入式场景中临时使用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2a735e4b5580a2a6bbd6572109b4c4f163c57462","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3a213503f483173e7eea76f2e7e3bdd6df7fd6f8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/79c3afb55942368921237d7b5355d48c52bdde20","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50357.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50357.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9d6896c0341bccdd67c38c8c663f362a4fabface/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50357.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/mitre/CVE-2022-50357","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50357.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-ff49-cc6c-4vwm/GHSA-ff49-cc6c-4vwm.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50357","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-50357.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71842.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/mitre/CVE-2022-50357"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0107","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50350","title":"Linux Kernel SCSI target iSCSI 竞争条件漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 SCSI target 子系统的 iSCSI 登录流程中存在竞争条件漏洞。恶意发起者在发送登录 PDU 后立即发送随机数据，触发 iscsi_target_sk_data_ready() 回调调度 login_work；当登录完成但 LOGIN_FLAGS_INITIAL_PDU 标志未被清除时，login_work 会无限重调度自身。此时若发起者断开连接，iscsit_conn 结构体被释放，login_work 将解引用已释放的 socket 结构，导致内核空指针解引用崩溃。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核中启用 iSCSI target 功能的系统，攻击者无需认证即可远程触发拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 4.7，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50350"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-16T17:15:34Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:17Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.0.16、6.1.2 或更高版本，包含提交 fec1b2fa62c1 / 3ecdca49ca49 / 1533b8b3058d 的修补。如无法升级，可在 iSCSI Target 端配置访问控制白名单，仅允许可信 Initiator 连接，并禁用未使用的 iSCSI 端口以缩小攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1533b8b3058db618409f41554ebe768c2e3acfae","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3ecdca49ca49d4770639d81503c873b6d25887c4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fec1b2fa62c162d03f5dcd7b03e3c89d3116d49f","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/40c65e734a16e244433aafd42706edabef09072d/cves/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50350.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2022/CVE-2022-50350.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9d6896c0341bccdd67c38c8c663f362a4fabface/2022/50xxx/CVE-2022-50350.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2022-50350","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2022-50350.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/36ddac9224d3973c64320c39be98ecc1f1ca5395/advisories/unreviewed/2025/09/GHSA-vh3w-x8qx-rvfm/GHSA-vh3w-x8qx-rvfm.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2022-50350","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/765c58d21032d831d20918314a5f12dad607f124/SSVC/data/2022/CVE-2022-50350.json","https://github.com/microsoft/AzureLinuxVulnerabilityData/blob/f446e11135d45cb1643208c82d3c441bd9ae1832/osv/AZL-71155.json","https://github.com/keryanchpn/ia-data/blob/534363d1afb19db8eaf67f9cab2c9be27811247b/data_fallback/data/Avis/CERTFR-2025-AVI-1070"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0107.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2022-0106","file_name":"2022/AVE-2022-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2022-50327","title":"Linux Kernel ACPI Processor Idle 空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 ACPI 处理器空闲管理子系统中存在空指针解引用漏洞，由于 acpi_fetch_acpi_dev() 函数返回值未经验证直接传入 acpi_device_hid() 使用，导致 NULL 指针解引用，造成内核崩溃。本地攻击者可利用该漏洞发起拒绝服务攻击，影响使用 ACPI 的 Linux 系统。该漏洞需本地低权限访问，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2022-50327"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-09-15T15:15:44Z","updated":"2026-06-17T05:23:14Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至修复版本：5.4.297、5.10.241、5.15.190、6.0.16、6.1.2 或更高版本（6.2 及以上不受影响）。该漏洞位于 drivers/acpi/processor_idle.c，acpi_fetch_acpi_dev() 返回值未经验证即传入 acpi_device_hid() 导致空指针解引用，需合入对应稳定分支的 backport 补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2437513a814b3e93bd02879740a8a06e52e2cf7d","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2ecd629c788bbfb96be058edade2e934d3763eaf","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8e8b5f12ee4ab6f5d252c9ca062a4ada9554e6d9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ad1190744da9d812da55b76f2afce750afb0a3bd","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b85f0e292f73f353eea915499604fbf50c8238b4","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/fdee7a0acc566c4194d40a501b8a1584e86cc208","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/10/msg00007.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2022/AVE-2022-0106.toml"}]